<title>USA: Credit Depot to sell $125 million in loans.</title>
<headline>Credit Depot to sell $125 million in loans.</headline>
<dateline>GAINESVILLE, Ga. 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Depot Corp on Wednesday said it will offer for sale $125 million of subprime first mortgage residential loans to an undisclosed financial instituion.</p>
<p>Gerald Sullivan, president and chief executive of Credit Depot, said in a statement, &quot;This agreement...provides Credit Depot with additional liquidity and operating flexibility to capitalize on the growth opportunities in the subprime residential real estate financing market.&quot;</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
